483 - I Need Thee Every Hour
 / 
Key: Ab
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 483
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[Ab/Eb]I need [Eb]Thee [Ab/Eb]every [Fm]hour,
[Cm/G]Most [Gdim]gracious [Eb/G]Lord;

Refrain:
[Ab]I need [Eb/Bb]thee, O I need thee;
[Cm/Eb]every [Eb7]hour I [Cm/Eb]need [Eb]thee;
[Bbm]O [Eb7/Db]bless me [Fm/C]now, [Ab]my Savior, [Cm]I [Ab]come to [Gdim]thee.

Verse 2:
[Ab/Eb]I need [Fm]thee [Eb]every [Ab7/Gb]hour; [Fm]stay thou nearby;
[Cm/G]temptations [Gdim]lose their power [Eb/G]when thou art nigh.

Verse 3:
[Ab/Eb]I need [Fm]thee [Eb]every [Ab7/Gb]hour, [Fm]in joy or pain;
[Cm/G]come quickly [Gdim]and abide, [Eb/G]or life is vain.

Verse 4:
[Ab/Eb]I need [Fm]thee [Eb]every [Ab7/Gb]hour; [Fm]teach me thy will;
[Cm/G]and thy [Gdim]rich promises [Eb/G]in me fulfill.
